# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATA GOVERNANCE - DO NOT RELAX THESE RULES
#
# The source corpus derives from "Clinical Cases in Tropical Medicine"
# (Elsevier, 2022), which is copyrighted. Neither the extracted text, the
# extracted figures, nor any generated teaching case derived from them may be
# committed to a public repository.
#
# Commit: code, aggregate metrics, plots, paraphrased illustrative examples.
# See PLAN.md section 5 and DATASHEET.md for the provenance rationale.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore cannot protect you from outputs saved INSIDE a notebook.
# Use nbstripout (see PLAN.md) - the original prototype carried ~199KB of
# generated clinical text in its saved cell outputs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
extracted_data/
outputs/
benchmark_image/
runs/
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.zip

# Human labels quote verbatim source text
eval_labels/
*.labels.jsonl

# Exception: committed report artifacts are aggregate-only and safe to publish
!reports/**/*.png
!reports/**/*.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
secrets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notebooks / editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
